{{Quote|The Otomok system? That brings back memories.|[[Armitage Hux]], to [[Rose Tico]]|<ref name="Star Wars: The Last Jedi: Expanded Edition">''[[Star Wars: The Last Jedi: Expanded Edition]]''</ref>}}
The '''Otomok system''',<ref name="Battlefront II">''[[Star Wars Battlefront II]]''</ref> also referred to simply as '''Otomok''',<ref name="Phasma">[[Phasma (novel)|''Phasma'']]</ref> was a [[star system]] located in [[the galaxy]]'s<ref name="Cobalt Squadron" /> [[Outer Rim Territories]]<ref name="Bomber Command" /> that contained the [[planet]]s [[Hays Major]] and [[Hays Minor]].<ref name="Cobalt Squadron" />

In [[10 ABY]],<ref name="Birthdate">''[[Star Wars: The Rise of Skywalker: The Visual Dictionary]]'' gives [[CS-9147]]'s age during the events of [[Star Wars: Episode IX The Rise of Skywalker|''Star Wars'': Episode IX ''The Rise of Skywalker'']] as twenty-five [[Standard year|years]] old. The reference book also places the events of ''The Rise of Skywalker'' one year after the [[Hosnian Cataclysm]], which is dated to [[34 ABY]] by ''[[Star Wars: Galactic Atlas]]''. As such, ''The Rise of Skywalker'' must have taken place in [[35 ABY]], and CS-9147 must have been [[Reproduction|born]] in [[10 ABY]].</ref> the future [[First Order jet trooper]] [[CS-9147]] was [[Reproduction|born]] in the system.<ref name="TROS VD">''[[Star Wars: The Rise of Skywalker: The Visual Dictionary]]''</ref> [[Time|Sometime]] later, the [[First Order]] [[Blockade of the Otomok system|blockaded]] the whole system<ref name="Cobalt Squadron" /> for [[ore]].<ref name="Age of Resistance">[[Age of Resistance - Rose Tico 1|''Age of Resistance - Rose Tico'' 1]]</ref> They destroyed a [[Otomok system Resistance base|Resistance base]] in the system.<ref name="100 Objects">''[[Star Wars 100 Objects]]''</ref>

